      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 3.81,
          "en": "So now that we're deriving",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.81,
          "end": 6.06,
          "en": "these answer buttons dynamically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.06,
          "end": 9.81,
          "en": "based on the actual answers in our list of answers here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.81,
          "end": 12.12,
          "en": "there are three things I want to change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.12,
          "end": 13.713,
          "en": "regarding these answers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.61,
          "end": 16.23,
          "en": "For one, the styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.23,
          "end": 19.53,
          "en": "I'd like to make sure that these answer buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.53,
          "end": 21.81,
          "en": "take up all the available space,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.81,
          "end": 25.59,
          "en": "leaving some empty space to the left and right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.59,
          "end": 27.45,
          "en": "That would be nice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.45,
          "end": 29.46,
          "en": "In addition, I wanna shuffle them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.46,
          "end": 30.99,
          "en": "because, as mentioned earlier,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.99,
          "end": 33.51,
          "en": "it's the first answer that is the correct one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.51,
          "end": 35.37,
          "en": "And knowing this will be important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 35.37,
          "end": 37.74,
          "en": "for later presenting the results.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 37.74,
          "end": 39.24,
          "en": "But for showing the answers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 39.24,
          "end": 40.71,
          "en": "I actually wanna shuffle them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 40.71,
          "end": 44.58,
          "en": "so that it's not always the first one that's correct.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 44.58,
          "end": 46.83,
          "en": "And third, I, of course, wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 46.83,
          "end": 49.23,
          "en": "that when we tap those answers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 49.23,
          "end": 51.66,
          "en": "we proceed to the next question",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 51.66,
          "end": 54.45,
          "en": "or, after going through all questions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 54.45,
          "end": 56.28,
          "en": "to the results screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 56.28,
          "end": 60.81,
          "en": "Now let's start with laying these things out correctly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 60.81,
          "end": 62.61,
          "en": "To make sure that these answers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 62.61,
          "end": 65.04,
          "en": "take all the available space,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 65.04,
          "end": 68.13,
          "en": "we can go to the column widget here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 68.13,
          "end": 70.83,
          "en": "And besides setting the mainAxisAlignment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 70.83,
          "end": 73.86,
          "en": "we can also set the crossAxisAlignment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 73.86,
          "end": 77.82,
          "en": "The main axis in a column is the vertical axis.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 77.82,
          "end": 81.75,
          "en": "The cross axis is the horizontal axis, therefore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 81.75,
          "end": 86.07,
          "en": "And if you set this to crossAxisAlignment.stretch,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 86.07,
          "end": 90.36,
          "en": "which is a built-in alignment option for the cross axis,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 90.36,
          "end": 92.31,
          "en": "the items inside of the column",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 92.31,
          "end": 96.84,
          "en": "will actually stretch out to be as wide as possible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 96.84,
          "end": 98.88300000000001,
          "en": "to fill the entire column width.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 99.96000000000001,
          "end": 102.03,
          "en": "But of course, that now also means,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 102.03,
          "end": 105.93,
          "en": "as you can see, that there is absolutely no space left",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 105.93,
          "end": 107.22,
          "en": "to the left and right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 107.22,
          "end": 109.86,
          "en": "And that's also not what I want here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 109.86,
          "end": 112.68,
          "en": "To make sure that there is some space left,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 112.68,
          "end": 114.69,
          "en": "we, therefore, have to add some padding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 114.69,
          "end": 117.03,
          "en": "or margin around the column.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 117.03,
          "end": 119.00999999999999,
          "en": "And here it won't really make a difference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 119.00999999999999,
          "end": 120.84,
          "en": "which of the two things we use here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 120.84,
          "end": 123.51,
          "en": "In theory, a padding is the internal spacing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 123.51,
          "end": 126.45,
          "en": "between content and the borders,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 126.45,
          "end": 128.4,
          "en": "as we have it here for the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 128.4,
          "end": 130.35,
          "en": "That would be the padding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 130.35,
          "end": 132.39,
          "en": "And the spacing between widgets,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 132.39,
          "end": 134.46,
          "en": "so this spacing here, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 134.46,
          "end": 136.623,
          "en": "would be the margin around the widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 138.12,
          "end": 140.1,
          "en": "Now visually, it here doesn't matter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 140.1,
          "end": 142.2,
          "en": "what we set for the entire column",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 142.2,
          "end": 144.03,
          "en": "to add some spacing around it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 144.03,
          "end": 146.88,
          "en": "And therefore here, I'll go for a margin",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 146.88,
          "end": 148.95,
          "en": "by picking this column here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 148.95,
          "end": 152.52,
          "en": "and refactoring this to wrap it with another widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 152.52,
          "end": 154.82999999999998,
          "en": "with the container widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 154.82999999999998,
          "end": 156.54,
          "en": "because that container widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 156.54,
          "end": 160.11,
          "en": "then has a margin argument that can be set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 160.11,
          "end": 162.03,
          "en": "And margin like padding,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 162.03,
          "end": 163.98,
          "en": "which you already saw earlier,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 163.98,
          "end": 168.84,
          "en": "takes this EdgeInsets class here provided by Flutter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 168.84,
          "end": 170.76,
          "en": "And with EdgeInsets.all,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 170.76,
          "end": 173.52,
          "en": "we can add the same margin in all directions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 173.52,
          "end": 176.1,
          "en": "So top, bottom, left, right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 176.1,
          "end": 178.92000000000002,
          "en": "And here we could set this to 20.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 178.92000000000002,
          "end": 180.45,
          "en": "That can also be turned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 180.45,
          "end": 182.733,
          "en": "into a constant value, thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 184.56,
          "end": 187.29,
          "en": "So with that, we now have some spacing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 187.29,
          "end": 190.59,
          "en": "Maybe I'll actually use 40 here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 190.59,
          "end": 192.12,
          "en": "Yeah, looks nicer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 192.12,
          "end": 194.91,
          "en": "And I also wanna center this text here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 194.91,
          "end": 197.57999999999998,
          "en": "And to do that, we can go to this text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 197.57999999999998,
          "end": 198.84,
          "en": "this Text widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 198.84,
          "end": 200.91,
          "en": "And there on the text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 200.91,
          "end": 204.18,
          "en": "not on the text style, but the text itself,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 204.18,
          "end": 208.56,
          "en": "you can set a TextAlign argument,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 208.56,
          "end": 210.6,
          "en": "which then can, for example, be set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 210.6,
          "end": 215.34,
          "en": "to TextAlign.center to, as you might guess,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 215.34,
          "end": 218.11,
          "en": "center the text in the middle horizontally",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 219.03,
          "end": 220.473,
          "en": "so that now it is centered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 221.55,
          "end": 223.59,
          "en": "So that's now the visual part.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 223.59,
          "end": 225.39,
          "en": "And I'll get back to this text here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 225.39,
          "end": 227.31,
          "en": "for example, later again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 227.31,
          "end": 230.67000000000002,
          "en": "But for now, I'm quite happy with how this looks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 230.67000000000002,
          "end": 233.16,
          "en": "But of course, the answers are still not shuffled,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 233.16,
          "end": 235.46,
          "en": "and that's, therefore, what we'll tackle next.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
